#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:4
msgid "DHCP Servers"
msgstr "Servidores DHCP"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:6
msgid ""
"``Infrastructure > Network > Integrations > (select Network Server) > "
"DHCP``"
msgstr "``Infrastructure > Network > Integrations > (select Network Server) > DHCP``"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:9
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Visão Geral"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:11
msgid ""
"The DHCP Servers section provides management of DHCP (Dynamic Host "
"Configuration Protocol) servers within a network integration. DHCP "
"servers automatically assign IP addresses and network configuration "
"parameters to devices on the network. |morpheus| syncs DHCP server "
"configurations from supported network integrations such as VMware NSX-T "
"and allows creation, editing, and deletion of DHCP servers directly from "
"the UI."
msgstr "A seção DHCP Servers fornece o gerenciamento de servidores DHCP (Dynamic Host Configuration Protocol) dentro de uma integração de rede. Servidores DHCP atribuem automaticamente endereços IP e parâmetros de configuração de rede a dispositivos na rede. O |morpheus| sincroniza configurações de servidor DHCP de integrações de rede suportadas, como VMware NSX-T, e permite a criação, edição e exclusão de servidores DHCP diretamente da UI."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:13
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:40
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Nota"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:13
msgid ""
"DHCP server management is available on network server integrations that "
"support this capability (``hasDhcpServers`` flag). Currently, NSX-T is "
"the primary integration supporting DHCP server management."
msgstr "O gerenciamento de servidor DHCP está disponível em integrações de servidor de rede que suportam essa capacidade (flag ``hasDhcpServers``). Atualmente, NSX-T é a principal integração que oferece suporte ao gerenciamento de servidor DHCP."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:16
msgid "Viewing DHCP Servers"
msgstr "Visualizando Servidores DHCP"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:18
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:28
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:47
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:57
msgid "Navigate to ``Infrastructure > Network > Integrations``"
msgstr "Navegue até ``Infrastructure > Network > Integrations``"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:19
msgid "Select the desired network server integration (e.g., NSX-T)"
msgstr "Selecione a integração de servidor de rede desejada (ex.: NSX-T)"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:20
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:30
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:49
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:59
msgid "Click the **DHCP** tab"
msgstr "Clique na aba **DHCP**"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:21
msgid "DHCP Servers are displayed in the upper section of the tab"
msgstr "Os Servidores DHCP são exibidos na seção superior da aba"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:23
msgid ""
"The list view displays DHCP server name, server address, lease time, and "
"status information."
msgstr "A visualização de lista exibe o nome do servidor DHCP, endereço do servidor, tempo de lease e informações de status."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:26
msgid "Adding a DHCP Server"
msgstr "Adicionando um Servidor DHCP"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:29
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:48
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:58
msgid "Select the desired network server integration"
msgstr "Selecione a integração de servidor de rede desejada"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:31
msgid "Click :guilabel:`+ ADD` in the DHCP Servers section"
msgstr "Clique em :guilabel:`+ ADD` na seção DHCP Servers"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:32
msgid "Complete the required fields (fields vary by integration type):"
msgstr "Preencha os campos obrigatórios (os campos variam conforme o tipo de integração):"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Nome"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:34
msgid "A name for the DHCP server in |morpheus|"
msgstr "Um nome para o servidor DHCP no |morpheus|"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst
msgid "Server Address"
msgstr "Endereço do Servidor"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:35
msgid "The IP address of the DHCP server"
msgstr "O endereço IP do servidor DHCP"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst
msgid "Lease Time"
msgstr "Tempo de Lease"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:36
msgid "The duration (in seconds) for IP address leases"
msgstr "A duração (em segundos) dos leases de endereço IP"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst
msgid "Edge Cluster"
msgstr "Edge Cluster"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:37
msgid "(NSX-T) The edge cluster to associate with this DHCP server"
msgstr "(NSX-T) O edge cluster a associar a este servidor DHCP"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst
msgid "Server IP"
msgstr "Server IP"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:38
msgid "(NSX-T) The IP address to assign to the server profile"
msgstr "(NSX-T) O endereço IP a atribuir ao perfil do servidor"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:40
msgid ""
"Additional fields may appear based on the network integration type and "
"its configured option types."
msgstr "Campos adicionais podem aparecer com base no tipo de integração de rede e em seus option types configurados."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:42
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:52
msgid "Click :guilabel:`SAVE`"
msgstr "Clique em :guilabel:`SAVE`"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:45
msgid "Editing a DHCP Server"
msgstr "Editando um Servidor DHCP"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:50
msgid "Click the pencil (edit) icon for the target DHCP server"
msgstr "Clique no ícone de lápis (editar) do servidor DHCP de destino"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:51
msgid "Modify the desired fields"
msgstr "Modifique os campos desejados"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:55
msgid "Deleting a DHCP Server"
msgstr "Excluindo um Servidor DHCP"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:60
msgid "Click the trash (delete) icon for the target DHCP server"
msgstr "Clique no ícone de lixeira (excluir) do servidor DHCP de destino"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:61
msgid "Confirm the deletion when prompted"
msgstr "Confirme a exclusão quando solicitado"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:63
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "Aviso"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:63
msgid ""
"Deleting a DHCP server will remove the server from both |morpheus| and "
"the upstream integration. Any clients relying on this server for address "
"assignment will be affected."
msgstr "Excluir um servidor DHCP o removerá tanto do |morpheus| quanto da integração upstream. Quaisquer clientes que dependam deste servidor para atribuição de endereços serão afetados."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:66
msgid "API"
msgstr "API"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:68
msgid ""
"DHCP servers are managed through the |morpheus| API at the following "
"endpoints:"
msgstr "Os servidores DHCP são gerenciados por meio da API do |morpheus| nos seguintes endpoints:"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:70
msgid "``GET /api/networks/servers/:serverId/dhcp-servers`` — List DHCP servers"
msgstr "``GET /api/networks/servers/:serverId/dhcp-servers`` — Listar servidores DHCP"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:71
msgid ""
"``GET /api/networks/servers/:serverId/dhcp-servers/:id`` — Get a specific"
" DHCP server"
msgstr "``GET /api/networks/servers/:serverId/dhcp-servers/:id`` — Obter um servidor DHCP específico"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:72
msgid ""
"``POST /api/networks/servers/:serverId/dhcp-servers`` — Create a DHCP "
"server"
msgstr "``POST /api/networks/servers/:serverId/dhcp-servers`` — Criar um servidor DHCP"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:73
msgid ""
"``PUT /api/networks/servers/:serverId/dhcp-servers/:id`` — Update a DHCP "
"server"
msgstr "``PUT /api/networks/servers/:serverId/dhcp-servers/:id`` — Atualizar um servidor DHCP"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:74
msgid ""
"``DELETE /api/networks/servers/:serverId/dhcp-servers/:id`` — Delete a "
"DHCP server"
msgstr "``DELETE /api/networks/servers/:serverId/dhcp-servers/:id`` — Excluir um servidor DHCP"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:77
msgid "Required Role Permissions"
msgstr "Permissões de Função Obrigatórias"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dhcp_servers.rst:79
msgid ""
"Access to DHCP server management requires the ``Infrastructure: Network "
"DHCP Server`` permission (``infrastructure-network-dhcp-server``) with "
"``read`` or ``full`` access."
msgstr "O acesso ao gerenciamento de servidor DHCP requer a permissão ``Infrastructure: Network DHCP Server`` (``infrastructure-network-dhcp-server``) com acesso ``read`` ou ``full``."

